.TH GHOST-DL 1 "2026-09-14" "ghost-dl 2.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghost-dl \- download game OSTs from KHInsider
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghost-dl
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIINPUT\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ghost-dl
downloads albums from the Kingdom Hearts Insider game soundtrack archive
(https://downloads.khinsider.com).
.PP
\fIINPUT\fR may be an album URL, an album slug, or a batch file of URLs/slugs
(one per line). With no \fIINPUT\fR, the search TUI is opened.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS General
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-tui
Open the search TUI.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-search " " \fIQUERY\fR
Search albums and print results.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-info
Show album info without downloading.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
Resolve files but do not download.
.SS Download
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default: current directory).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-threads " " \fIN\fR
Parallel workers (default: CPU/2, max 8).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFMT\fR
Audio format, or a comma-separated preference list (for example
.BR flac,mp3 ).
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-default ", " \-y ", " \-\-yes
Pick the highest quality format without prompting.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-cover
Skip album art.
.TP
.B \-\-cover\-only
Download only album art.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Overwrite existing files.
.SS Logging
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quiet
Suppress progress and log messages.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Show extra log messages.
.SH TUI KEYS
.TP
type, Enter
Search.
.TP
Esc
Return to the search bar.
.TP
Up/Down, j/k
Move selection.
.TP
Enter / i
Load album info.
.TP
f
Cycle audio format.
.TP
d
Download selected album.
.TP
/
Focus search.
.TP
q
Quit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ghost-dl
ghost-dl \-\-search celeste
ghost-dl \-d \-f flac minecraft
ghost-dl \-o ~/Music https://downloads.khinsider.com/game-soundtracks/album/minecraft
ghost-dl \-\-info persona-5
ghost-dl \-d urls.txt
.EE
.SH FILES
Each album is written to a directory named
.IR "YEAR \- Title (Type)"
under the output directory.
